 {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2089898914845162", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827286_2089898918178495_4497274503325493520_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DAPT6WIH9ywQ7kNvwEzkXZ-&_nc_oc=Adlr1AelFINMe1GcyP2d3eJStpm5UEYzep1wJjmXJ4BXvSH36s_uxrzLn1cya4KgCtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQWWpmJqcDYIngo0K5H84TizB4gaEEXUfbWVk9qv91QQ&oe=69A44B80"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "682203651434927", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827720_682203654768260_1451577516060763779_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NjDbSqPaGl4Q7kNvwF_BQqO&_nc_oc=Adk4LyaA48d8S-ID8yErACM1RbIUm0YGZFBJQIr5euAuEPgXZz7AqxPlj87E1VjE0lY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4HleMrJRLQZcY70NrTPoqoz19J7FbygD6I3QqShy49Q&oe=69A44899"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Space Lander", "keywords": ["Space", "Lunar", "Rocket", "scifi", "Landing"], "long_description": "Space Lander is a mixed reality landing game built where your real-world space becomes a landing site.\n\nYou\u2019ll start with a rocket booster that needs to land upright on a tower\u2014classic, clean, and surprisingly tough. Then there\u2019s the smaller spacecraft: quick, nimble, and built for weaving through tight spots and dodging floating debris before touching down.\n\nEach mission has a higher difficulty; every surface becomes part of the challenge. And with limited fuel, every second counts.\n\nIt\u2019s not about flashy explosions or over-the-top graphics. It\u2019s about control. Precision. The quiet tension of sticking the landing when it really counts.", "short_description": "Space Lander drops you into the pilot seat of rockets and ships, each with their own physics and challenges. It\u2019s you, gravity, and just enough fuel to make a safe landing."}]}, "developer_name": "RudyAA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spacelandervr/priva